            <div xml:id="d331">

                <pb facs="0618" n="492" sameAs="frus:frus1925v01/pg492"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">875.01/265: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Albania</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Grant-Smith</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-01-31T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 31,
                                1925—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>5. 1. Your No. 8, January 29, 5 p.m. and No. 6, January 25, 9 a.m. You are
                    authorized to extend recognition to the new régime in Albania and to acknowledge
                    the receipt of official notification of establishment of the republic.</p>
                <p>2. Department’s No. 1, January 9, 7 p.m. and your despatch No. 362, December
                        12.<anchor n="5" xml:id="d331-f1"/> When above action has been taken you are
                    authorized leave of absence as requested.</p>
                <p>3. Telegraph action taken.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
